+{"n_kv_max": 8704, "n_batch": 2048, "n_ubatch": 512, "flash_attn": 0, "n_gpu_layers": -1, "n_threads": 32, "n_threads_batch": 32, "pp": 512, "tg": 128, "n_kv": 2048, "t_pp": 1.360647, "speed_pp": 376.291595, "t_tg": 2.274003, "speed_tg": 56.288403 }
+```
